# Gradius III Legends, MSX2+ machine: the POWER METER SELECT screen (AUTOEXEC.BAS lines
# 110-230: BLOAD "select.sr5",S, the box drawn with LINE ...,10,B and moved with two
# LINE ...,B,XOR). It comes at boot, before the title, and waits for Space; no Space
# here, DOWN every 4 s moves the box (cyclic over the 4 rows).
option machine 2
option sound 0
30s   DOWN 10 every 4s until 100s
